WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.830
Saizou!

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.780
I'll handle this.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.220
Utsutsu and Rui, take Shichigen 
and get inside, now.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.530
Let's go.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:41.270
Yeah.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:42.850
Let's go.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.760
Hachisu!

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.780
Let's finish this up, quick.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:20.590
Yeah.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.030
<b><i>We Must See the Lotus Flowers Together</i></b>

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.210
It isn't fair.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.790
You're going to make me handle the rest?

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.490
Just hang on a little.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:14.540
I'll go put an end to all of this.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.280
Hibiki is no longer herself.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:28.660
Within her, she carries the heart of Oboro,

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.840
who suffered after she fell in 
love with Kouga Gennosuke.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.700
Damn you, Joujin!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.740
The Gorouza fires multiple rounds at once, 
and you have two Lotus Root guns?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.360
Last gifts from Gorone-dono.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.240
Stop... Wake up!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:31.800
Stop it, Hibiki!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:47.260
My techniques are stopping 
her from holding back.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.620
Let's go.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.630
<i>If I can reflect it with my Spearing Eye...</i>

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:16.470
<i>If it works, I can break Joujin's technique!</i>

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.420
<i>No...</i>

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.210
<i>Hibiki may not be able to bear it.</i>

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:25.490
What's wrong, Kouga Hachirou?

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:30.790
Will you try to save your own life by 
using the Spearing Eye on Iga Hibiki,

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.430
and in so doing, intend to kill her?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.860
This is the end.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.200
What are you doing?

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.960
Now, come.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.800
You don't need to tell me!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.450
<i>Even with my eyes closed,</i>

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:14.130
<i>I can sense your every movement,</i>

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.470
<i>Hibiki...</i>

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.180
Curse you!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.020
Hibiki!

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.360
Gennosuke-sama...

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.010
I've been waiting for you for so long.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:36.480
What is this place?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:40.930
This is probably what powers the Murakumo.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.190
I wish Gorone could have seen this.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.740
Right.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.190
Let's hurry.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.200
What about Shikibu and Hachisu?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.200
There's no time to wait.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.900
Indeed... They'll be fine.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.330
They're a good pair.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.220
Yeah.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.470
Hibiki, wake up!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.160
It's me, Hachirou!

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.600
I'm not Gennosuke!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:08.670
No, you are Gennosuke-sama.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.060
We finally... finally meet!

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.470
You cannot break my technique so easily.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:21.780
Hachirou, just be happy 
that your Spearing Eye

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:26.980
did not cause Hibiki to slit her own throat.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.160
Give it up, Kouga Hachirou.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.490
Joujin-sama's power could never be 
overcome by the likes of you.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:39.410
<i>Hibiki, are you no longer...</i>

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:50.340
Will you leap into my Adamantite Tower?

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.060
<i>Naubo akyasha kyarabaya.</i>

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.310
<i>On ari kyamari bori sowaka!</i>

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:32.020
We'll just have to head upward.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.120
Yeah.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.210
Someone's coming.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.090
I smell a woman.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:44.020
Shichigen's technique was originally 
intended to seduce women.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:46.100
It's coming from the right corridor.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.280
The rest of you, head left.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:58.400
If it's a woman, it's probably Yasha Itaru.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.860
Watch out for her Destiny's Passage.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.510
I'll avenge Saizou.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.140
No woman can withstand your technique.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:38.930
Yasha Itaru, in the end, you're a woman, too.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.660
You cannot resist me.

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:48.160
Shichigen.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.240
Mother...

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.940
Who's there?

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.270
Show yourself!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.060
Is this the work of some monster?

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.140
You cannot deceive me.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.320
Show yourself!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:24.760
Shichigen...

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:27.250
Shichigen.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.180
Shichigen!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:32.830
Mother?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.480
Shichigen.

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:38.920
Mother!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.260
Mother!

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.100
Good boy...

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:57.860
Now, do as your mother tells you.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.110
Looks like the others went on ahead.

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:07.120
Yeah.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:20.820
Choose.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:23.800
Like your brother, you are 
not good with your hands.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.220
This weapon will be what 
you entrust with your life.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.500
And you must master it.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.150
I can't keep...

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.580
You must not say another word.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.650
When you stop, you die, Hachisu.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.790
Shoulders back. Squeeze the trigger hard.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.180
Like this.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:16.920
Don't worry.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.430
It takes time to get good.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.350
Don't hold your breath.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:33.920
Okay!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.370
I did it!

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.050
Hachisu, do you like your older brother?

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.490
Yeah!

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.670
I see.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.550
And do you like your pistol?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.300
Yeah, I do!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.060
Which do you like better, then?

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.630
We are ninjas.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:43.820
A ninja must rank the things they like.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.320
Brother!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.750
I see.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:51.570
But we aren't the ones who decide 
the real way things are ranked.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.900
It's already been decided.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.710
Don't let them get away!

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.220
Shoot, Hachisu...

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.680
Don't worry about me!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.850
Brother!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.600
That is what you chose.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:17.150
Don't betray your choice!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:19.440
Shoot!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:35.010
The whole world comes down 
to the roll of the dice.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:39.100
They roll and roll on the mat.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.270
You dream and dream. And at the end,

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.850
you will eventually die.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:47.980
Shikibu, get back!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.020
It's Yasha Itaru.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.360
Don't look into her mirror.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.000
Right.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:54.150
What?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.190
Shichigen!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.640
Hachisu!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.090
He is my slave now.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.670
A living puppet.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.750
We're as good as done here.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.300
Go after your other comrades.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:33.860
You!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.670
I have heard of you.

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:43.000
So you die without that armor?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:47.750
Then, take it off and go to hell.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:08.180
Let me see you explode without your armor!

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:34.270
You're so ugly, though, monster!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.450
No...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:40.160
The only monster here is you!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:47.940
What are you doing?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.020
I'm about...

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:57.340
to change that disgusting 
destiny... of yours!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:02.320
You go to hell, too!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.050
My eyes...

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.850
I can't see...

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.380
You see now?

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:38.490
That is your destiny.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.490
I refuse to believe it.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.290
A destiny like this...

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.870
I refuse to believe it!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:54.390
Impossible...

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:57.250
You were struck by Destiny's Passage.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:01.880
You just... broke the spell.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:06.370
You told me not to believe in destiny.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.420
Shikibu...

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:14.900
Decide your own path in life.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.690
Just like I did.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.070
Right...

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.430
Brother?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:33.670
Looks like I've gotta die here...

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:36.630
But I'm happy.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.800
Because I'm not alone.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.710
You're going to explode, along with me!

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:49.320
How crude of you, to interrupt 
my journey into death...

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:53.750
Don't worry...

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.580
Hachisu and I are going to heaven!

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.060
You're...

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:02.900
going to...

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.640
hell!

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:29.600
<i>Naubo akyasha kyarabaya.</i>

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:32.600
<i>On basara kirikiri sowaka.</i>

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:33.880
Hibiki...

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.030
Now, lie together.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.270
Do it.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:43.910
Let me see you fornicate like beasts!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:27.090
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:28.560
Kill one another.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:31.880
The Kouga and the Iga have 
always been rivals.

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:38.850
It is far more natural for you to kill 
one another than to be friends.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:38.850
<b><i>Remembrance Must Fade</i></b>
